Redesign this website based on the existing logo and keep its rural identity, but elevate it to a modern, premium and emotionally strong brand.

GOAL:
Transform the website into a clean, modern, trustworthy farm brand presentation that feels natural, calm and authentic — not corporate, not aggressive.

BRAND DIRECTION:
• Use the colors directly derived from the logo as the primary palette (extract exact shades and build a full system: primary, secondary, accent, background, hover, muted).
• Preserve the rustic farm character.
• Design must feel organic, airy and natural.
• Avoid hard contrasts, neon tones or overly sharp gradients.
• Use soft shadows and subtle depth.

STYLE:
• Modern minimal layout
• Generous white/neutral space
• Rounded corners (medium radius)
• Soft earthy color palette
• Elegant but readable typography (clean sans-serif for text, slightly organic or humanist style for headings)
• Subtle micro-animations (hover lift, soft fade, smooth transitions)

LAYOUT IMPROVEMENTS:
• Strong hero section with emotional photography (horses, nature, tractor, countryside atmosphere)
• Clear call-to-action buttons (Book visit / Contact / Riding lessons)
• Structured sections:
    - About the farm
    - Services (riding lessons, trips, boarding, events)
    - Gallery
    - Testimonials
    - Contact
• Use card components for services
• Create visual hierarchy with spacing instead of borders

VISUAL ELEMENTS:
• Add subtle decorative illustrations inspired by farm life (horses silhouettes, hay bales, wooden textures, countryside lines)
• Keep them minimal and low-opacity in background
• Use natural textures only very subtly (no heavy wood patterns)

UX IMPROVEMENTS:
• Make navigation clear and simple
• Improve readability
• Use consistent button style
• Add hover states
• Ensure good mobile layout

MOOD:
Calm.
Authentic.
Warm.
Trustworthy.
Professional but still human.

DO NOT:
• Do not change the logo.
• Do not make it corporate.
• Do not overuse gradients.
• Do not make it dark or aggressive.

OUTPUT:
Create full desktop layout + mobile version.
Include color system and typography scale.